   "en": "A powerful clan that has long defended the northern borders faces annihilation after years of war. In the midst of battle, a young warrior encounters an enigmatic master who grants him a forbidden technique—the ability to absorb not just energy, but entire martial arts. As sects and noble houses clash for dominance, he must harness this fearsome power to defy fate and reclaim his clan’s honor."
